#. どうだ、見つかったか？
msgctxt "0001 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "How's it goin'? You find him?"
msgstr ""

#. ううん…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No..."
msgstr ""

#. チッ、どこ行きやがったんだ…
msgctxt "0003 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Shit... Man, where the hell'd he go?"
msgstr ""

#. 空気を読まねぇアイツの事だ…
msgctxt "0004 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"He's got his head stuck so far up his ass, who knows\n"
"*what's* goin' on with him?"
msgstr ""

#. のんきに朝から風呂でも入ってんじゃねぇかと
#. 思ったんだがな…
msgctxt "0005 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "I figured maybe he was takin' a bath or somethin'."
msgstr ""

#. ところでよォ、苗木。
#. オメェは<CLT 3>朝風呂<CLT>好きか？
msgctxt "0006 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "So what about you? You a <CLT 3>morning bath<CLT> kinda guy?"
msgstr ""

#. いいぜェ、
#. 一晩中、バイクで風を切った後の朝風呂はよォ！
msgctxt "0007 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"After spending all night ridin' your hog, wind in your\n"
"face, there's nothin' better than a morning dip!"
msgstr ""

#. 冷えた体に染み渡る熱さと、魂に凝った熱さが
#. 身と心を揺さぶる…！
msgctxt "0008 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"The hot water loosens ya up, and the heat of your soul\n"
"gets your heart and body pumpin'!"
msgstr ""

#. う、うーん…
#. 僕にはちょっとわからないかな…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"S-Sure thing. I'll have to take your word for...all\n"
"that."
msgstr ""

#. あぁん？
#. んだよ、つまんねー男だな…
msgctxt "0010 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"What, you don't know what I'm talkin' about? Fuckin'\n"
"nerd..."
msgstr ""

#. 男なら裸のつきあいってのも大事だろ？
#. 今度つきあえよ？　な？
msgctxt "0011 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Guys gotta expose themselves to each other, ya know?\n"
"Come with me next time, you'll see!"
msgstr ""

#. か、考えておくね…
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-I'll think about it..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>というか、ここにいる限り
#. バイクで走るのは無理じゃないかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I mean...it's not like you've been \"riding your\n"
"hog\" here in the school, right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ま、ここには<CLT 3>アイツもいねぇ<CLT>し
#. 別の場所を探すか。
msgctxt "0014 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Well...<CLT 3>he's not here<CLT>. I better go look somewhere\n"
"else."
msgstr ""

#. そうだね…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Good idea..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカーだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Lockers...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>１つだけ開いているものがあるけど、
#. ここにも何もないみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>One of them is unlocked, but I don't see anything\n"
"inside.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このマッサージチェアに座ってたら…
#. おじさん扱いされたりしてね…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Using this massage chair would make me feel kinda\n"
"old...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0019 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0020 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
